WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.558
Unit sixteen. Fire Safety at Home!

2
00:00:04.509 --> 00:00:08.226
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.276 --> 00:00:11.543
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.593 --> 00:00:15.475
Today we learn about Fire Safety at Home. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.439 --> 00:00:19.756
Fire. Say it with me. Fire!

6
00:00:23.239 --> 00:00:26.822
Smoke. Say it with me. Smoke!

7
00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:34.122
Matches. Say it with me. Matches!

8
00:00:37.632 --> 00:00:41.132
Stove. Say it with me. Stove!

9
00:00:44.632 --> 00:00:48.165
Exit. Say it with me. Exit!

10
00:00:51.668 --> 00:00:54.735
Crawl. Say it with me. Crawl!

11
00:00:58.235 --> 00:01:01.769
Call. Say it with me. Call!

12
00:01:05.266 --> 00:01:08.633
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

13
00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:19.968
Matches and fire are not toys. If there is smoke, I crawl low to the exit and get out fast. Then I tell an adult to call for help.

14
00:01:20.018 --> 00:01:21.218
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.469 --> 00:01:27.762
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.812 --> 00:01:28.962
Matches!

17
00:01:30.051 --> 00:01:35.314
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.364 --> 00:01:36.514
Call!

19
00:01:37.285 --> 00:01:42.929
Did you know? Smoke rises, so the cleanest air is low near the floor!

20
00:01:42.979 --> 00:01:45.000
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.681 --> 00:01:53.064
Think and answer. What should you do if you see smoke?

22
00:01:53.114 --> 00:01:54.264
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.645 --> 00:02:00.595
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.645 --> 00:02:03.285
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

